Package: xserver-xlibre-input-joystick
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${xinpdriver:Depends},
Conflicts: xserver-xorg-input-joystick
Provides:
 ${xinpdriver:Provides},
 xserver-xorg-input-joystick
Description: XLibre X server -- joystick input driver
 This package provides the driver for joysticks. It allows to control the pointer with
 a joystick, and is not needed for games etc.
 .
 More information about XLibre can be found at:
 <URL:http://XLibre.net>
 .
 This package is built from the XLibre xf86-input-joystick driver module.

Package: xserver-xlibre-input-joystick-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: all
Conflicts: xserver-xorg-input-joystick-dev
Provides: xserver-xorg-input-joystick-dev
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Multi-Arch: foreign
Description: XLibre X server -- joystick input driver (development headers)
 This package provides the development headers for the joystick input
 driver found in xserver-xlibre-input-joystick. Non-developers likely have
 little use for this package.
 .
 More information about XLibre can be found at:
 <URL:http://XLibre.net>
 .
 This package is built from the XLibre xf86-input-joystick driver module.

